OL,3,AMeta fined $25bn for 'lies' over user
OL,4,Adata privacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fine is the largest to date against
OL,7,FMeta, which has either been fined or
OL,8,Fagreed to settle several other lawsuits
OL,9,Fthis year, including an $18bn deal with
OL,10,FCalifornia over child safety.
